WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.430 --> 00:00:02.210
So you've been given the AI tools.

2
00:00:02.600 --> 00:00:05.080
Maybe your boss said,
“find a way to use this.”

3
00:00:05.250 --> 00:00:06.830
Maybe you downloaded an app at home

4
00:00:06.850 --> 00:00:08.650
and just stared at the empty box.

5
00:00:09.260 --> 00:00:11.330
Most people stop at asking questions.

6
00:00:11.510 --> 00:00:15.200
That's fine, but it's the smallest thing
these tools can do.

7
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:17.580
The real win is handing it a job.

8
00:00:17.720 --> 00:00:18.920
Say you're a fitness coach.

9
00:00:19.130 --> 00:00:22.130
Tell it about your client:
forty-two, a sore knee,

10
00:00:22.170 --> 00:00:23.300
three sessions a week,

11
00:00:23.320 --> 00:00:25.510
wants to run ten kilometres
in twelve weeks.

12
00:00:26.090 --> 00:00:27.700
Then ask for the twelve-week plan,

13
00:00:27.790 --> 00:00:29.410
a short check-in message for each week,

14
00:00:29.430 --> 00:00:32.300
and a list of easy swaps
if the knee flares up.

15
00:00:32.480 --> 00:00:35.630
You get a first draft of all of that
in a couple of minutes.

16
00:00:35.890 --> 00:00:37.820
You still check it. You're the coach.

17
00:00:38.430 --> 00:00:40.555
Doing it safely comes down
to three habits.

18
00:00:40.575 --> 00:00:42.910
Only share what you're allowed to share.

19
00:00:43.080 --> 00:00:44.520
Check anything that matters.

20
00:00:44.720 --> 00:00:46.910
And read it before you send it.

21
00:00:47.060 --> 00:00:49.030
Here you'll find ideas for your job,

22
00:00:49.120 --> 00:00:52.370
little things to try at home,
and short clips like this one.

23
00:00:52.640 --> 00:00:55.620
Whatever industry you're in,
you'll find something here.

24
00:00:55.730 --> 00:00:57.930
Finance. Marketing. Healthcare.

25
00:00:58.310 --> 00:01:00.800
Hospitality. Construction. Education.

26
00:01:01.370 --> 00:01:02.170
And plenty more.

27
00:01:03.700 --> 00:01:06.110
The best place to begin is the start page.

28
00:01:06.130 --> 00:01:07.670
It takes about five minutes.

29
00:01:08.010 --> 00:01:08.800
See you there.

